  "title": "Pasta with Spinach Pesto Sauce",
  "description": "A flavorful puree of spinach, tofu, lemon juice, garlic, chicken broth, Parmesan cheese, pepper and Italian seasoning is added to sauteed onions and mushrooms to make a mouthwatering sauce for hot pasta. Add bacon bits and Parmesan to serve.",
  "authors": [
    "Sheila Martin"
  ],
